  "content_html": "<p class=\"mobile-date-eyebrow\">19th September 2026</p>\n<div class=\"beat beat-sighting\">\n\n\n<div class=\"beat-content\">\n  <div class=\"beat-row1\">\n    <a class=\"beat-label sighting\" href=\"/elsewhere/sighting/\">Sighting</a>\n    <span class=\"beat-title\">10:10 AM – 10:10 AM</span>\n    <span class=\"beat-commit\">&mdash; California Sea Lion, Brandt&#x27;s Cormorant, in Pillar Point Harbor, CA, US</span>\n  </div>\n  <captioned-image-gallery class=\"sighting-detail-gallery\" max-row-items=\"2\">\n    <figure><a href=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/737061413/large.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/737061413/large.jpg\" alt=\"California Sea Lion\" loading=\"lazy\" data-width=\"2048\" data-height=\"1365\"></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/401567605\" title=\"View observation on iNaturalist\">California Sea Lion</a></figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/737061040/large.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/737061040/large.jpg\" alt=\"Brandt&#x27;s Cormorant\" loading=\"lazy\" data-width=\"1365\" data-height=\"2048\"></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/401567341\" title=\"View observation on iNaturalist\">Brandt&#x27;s Cormorant</a></figcaption></figure>\n  </captioned-image-gallery>\n<div class=\"beat-note blogmark-body\"><p>I only noticed this after I had taken the photo: Morris <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/15/sighting-391300422/\">the Northern Gannet</a> is peeking out from behind the base of the sign.</p></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"entryFooter\">Posted <a href=\"/2026/Sep/19/\">19th September 2026</a> at 5:10 pm</div>\n<p class=\"edit-page-link\" data-admin-url=\"/admin/blog/beat/4951/\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n</div> <!-- #primary -->\n\n<div id=\"secondary\">\n\n\n\n</div> <!-- #secondary -->\n</div> <!-- #wrapper -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"ft\">\n    <